Date:   Thu Sep 3 22:33:52 2026 +0200

    fix(core): compose observer around caller-supplied createHandler

    createToolRuntime silently discarded the caller-supplied createHandler
    factory whenever an observer was configured: createObservedHandler
    invoked runToolEffect directly instead of the resolved handler factory.
    Compose observation around the resolved handler so createHandler IS
    invoked when both observer and createHandler are set, while the
    observer-only path keeps the default withErrorHandling semantics.

